      "content": "i know what people say about making amends and growing from mistakes but what if some things just can't be fixed? it feels more like i'm just a net negative to everyone around me. it’s like i’m stuck in this loop of just existing and making things worse. it feels so much more logical to just stop being a burden than to keep pretending i can fix it.",
